<p>
If you're a technical person, who values learning the technical stuff much more deeply, you'll get much more value out of reading this 
<Navigable 
  content={"article from Dave Cheney"}
  href={"https://dave.cheney.net/2016/04/27/dont-just-check-errors-handle-them-gracefully"}
